  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-weread",
      "text": "[English](README.md) | [中文](README.zh.md)\n\nWeChat Reading (WeRead) right-sidebar bookshelf and chapter reader for [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Right-sidebar panel: bookshelf, store search, prominent Continue card\n- Shelf filters (All / Reading / Finished) with progress and reading-time labels\n- Cover-first bookshelf, with a list view toggle\n- Merges local vs cloud progress by recency; syncs progress and reading time back to WeRead\n- Sign in with WeChat QR or Cookie; expired sessions offer a one-tap re-login\n- Reader dock with chapter progress and TOC; ←→ / Space / side-click paging\n- Demo book when signed out\n- Agent tools (registered when the names are free): `weread_shelf`, `weread_search`, `weread_book`, `weread_chapter`"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "> If [weread-export](https://github.com/zhengjy01/weread-export) is already installed, some tool names may already be taken; this plugin still serves the sidebar UI and `/api/weread`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add wwjzzy/dsh-weread\n```\n\nOr install from a local path / npm once published.\n\nRestart Harness after install, then open the **WeRead** tab in the right sidebar."
    },
    {
      "section": "Config",
      "text": "Optional Cordis config (also editable in the panel):\n\n```yaml\ncookie: ''            # weread.qq.com Cookie header; leave empty to use QR login or demo mode\nsyncProgress: false   # write chapter progress and reading time back to WeRead\n```\n\nTurn on **进度回写** in Settings to sync while you read. Reports use the same signed `POST /web/book/read` body as the official web reader, with idle detection so an open tab is not counted as reading time."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
